window.products.push({"id":521035,"name":"3 in 1 Slim Can Cooler for 12 OZ Skinny Can, Regular Can & Beer Bottle - Keep Cold for 6 Hours - Double Walled Insulated Stainless Steel Vacuum Bevera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J8HmPvwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FITS 12 OZ CANS & BOTTLES --- 3 in 1 versatility design fits most 12 oz Slim, Regular cans and beer bottles of white claw, seltzer, truly, corona, etc. Keeps your drinks cold and refreshing till last drop. 20X CLODER & NO SWEAT TECHNOLOGY --- Double-walled vacuum insulation with an extra copper layer keeps your beverage cold for hours. Sweat-proof powder coated exterior fully resistant to condensation. And non-slip base prevent slipping and tipping over. LIFETIME GUARANTEE --- Made of premium 18/8 durable stainless steel and 100% BPA free, rust-proof. Any quality problems with can coozie, we will fully refund you or send you a replacement. EASY TO USE & HOLD --- Simply push the can into the cooler, reloading with pulling the can or unscrewing the gasket. Lightweight and unique external structure design make you easier to carry and hold. And it's cup holder friendly. GIFTABLE & MULTI-SCENE USE --- Ideal gift for those love drinks. No worries about all kinds of outdoor sports, gatherings, parties, or trips. This is definitely your best choice and a perfect gift for family and friends. Get your can cooler now and keep your life always cool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J8HmPvwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYTHQUATE","source_asin":"B09B3JFMZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3JFMZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3JFMZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":521036,"name":"Metrokane Mighty Mini Bar Juicer, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWANC68NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description It's easy to squeeze fresh limes for Brazilian caipirinhas and Puerto Rican mojitos with the Mighty Mini Bar Juicer. A small version of the award-winning Metrokane Mighty OJ, this retro-style juicer only takes up only a small corner of your home bar or countertop, but has all the gear power to quickly extract juice from lemons and limes. Crafted in beautiful stainless steel, the unit features a long lever for pressing the citrus, and a U-shape base that allows you to slip a glass underneath the liquid dispenser. The extractor cone is removable for quick and easy cleanup. Imported. 6-1/2Hx4-3/4Wx5-1/2L\". Amazon.com Taking up just a small amount of bar space but looking mighty good, the Mighty Mini juicer makes a great gift for the home bartender. Sized for lemons and limes rather than oranges, the 1950s-look juicer is ideal for making fresh-squeezed citrus juice to add to a margarita, daiquiri, mojito, or other cocktail. The lever operates a strong rack-and-pinion gear system that squeezes all traces of juice out of the lime or lemon half. A small, low cup (not provided) is required to fit underneath the spout. After use, the stainless-steel cone and funnel remove for rinsing clean under running water. If a more constant demand of fresh-squeezed juice is in the offing, try the Mighty OJ Juicer, Metrokane's larger, original version with the same polished-chrome retro styling. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWANC68NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metrokane","source_asin":"B0001ZYYXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001ZYYXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001ZYYXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
