window.products.push({"id":521050,"name":"LED Lightning Bolt Neon Signs, Neon Signs for Bedroom Battery or USB Powered Hanging Led Neon Lights, Neon Signs for Wall Decor Christmas Wedding Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdriY0vKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Lightning Bolt Neon Signs]: Lightning neon sign made of premium material durable and lightweight, LED neon signs use at low voltage and energy saving, no heat after long-time use. Neon signs is very quiet when being lighted up and the light is softer and uniform can be used safely in kid's bedroom. Pink / blue / warm yellow led neon light create a dreamy and romantic atmosphere for your bedroom. [Battery Or USB Powered]: LED lightning shaped neon lights requires 3 AA-batteries (not included) or a USB power supply, plug in the USB port (computer/mobile power bank/charger). Do not use USB and battery charging methods at the same time, as this may cause the battery to heat up. [Easy To Use ]: Neon signs for wall decor have one hole on the top, you can hang it on the wall or place it on the table, which is convenient to install and operation. Neon light sign comes with an easy to use On / Off switch,ensures quickly turning the lightning bolt light on and off. [Perfect Gift & Home Decor]: LED signs for bedroom wall decor is a great decor for home, bedroom, living room, window, office, kids room, porch, dorm, bar, wedding. Neon sign for bedroom is widely used, not only decorate for your home everywhere, but also as a perfect family & friend gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Festive, New Year, birthday, party, performance. Prepare to enjoy the colorful and interesting life brought by hanging LED signs. [Warm and Artistic]: Pink neon light for wall decoration offers a romantic ambiance in your room, blue lightning LED lights are wonderful neon lights for college teen girls or cool gaming room, warm yellow led signs the light is softer and uniform perfect as night light for your little kids bedroom, and there will be no noise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdriY0vKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MasBekTe","source_asin":"B09JVPV897","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JVPV897","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JVPV897","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
