window.products.push({"id":521185,"name":"DolliBu Brown Moose Plush Neck Pillow - Soft Travel Neck Pillow Animal for Neck & Head Support, Cute Wild Life Stuffed Pillow Accessory for Naps, Nove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O29Evb5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester THE WILD LIFE TRAVEL NECK PILLOW COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Stay comfortable and enjoy the journey! DolliBu Moose Plush Neck Pillow is a super soft travel buddy, cute & cuddly animal critter for kids. Perfect for kids to play with while enjoying your family vacation. A must-have pet plush neck pillow that will provide added comfort for your playful kids indoors and outdoors. THE TRAVEL PILLOW PLUSH TOY IS FOR ANIMAL LOVERS WHO LOVE TO TRAVEL – Perfect neck pillow accessory for kids in cars that can be used to catch some sleep or during stopovers on a road trip. Stuffed toys provide much-needed comfort for kids and they may also develop various skills such as social skills, communication skills, & imagination. The novelty travel pillow plush makes a great gift, giveaway, prize, or souvenir in a children's party. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF SOFT TRAVEL PILLOW NECK SUPPORT - Includes 1 Dollibu Super Soft Moose Plush Neck Pillow For Kids. Ideal stuffed neck pillow head support for any travel transportation. Don't forget to bring the lightweight neck pillow for your kid on your next trip whether it's a long drive or a long flight. The moose travel pillow measures 11\" inches, perfect size for kids, children in car seats, and even adults. HIGH-QUALITY WILD ANIMAL NECK PILLOW – Made with premium quality, soft polyester materials & plush fabric, suitable for little kids. Pillow is super soft and comfortable and flexible to neck. Kids who are tired from playing all day can use a power nap and this moose neck pillow. The plush neck pillow makes it easy and comfy even when sleeping in moving vehicles such as cars, trains, boats, airplanes, etc. IDEAL USE FOR THE MOOSE PILLOW FOR KIDS - Enjoy an adventure with your kids & have a necessary nap to regain strength & have some more fun! The moose neck pillow helps kids sleep comfortably in cars & other vehicles. Prevents children from having a stiff neck & suffer from muscle pains & headaches due to uncomfortable sleep. The adorable moose attracts kids & makes them feel more secured when they see a cute animal plush in their pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O29Evb5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B00GNTJMOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GNTJMOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GNTJMOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
