window.products.push({"id":521627,"name":"Phoenixs Stained Glass Window Decoration Red Flame Firebird Window Decor Mythical Bird - Family Lucky Blessing Pendant - Commemorating Lost Loved Ones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mj-Eu0sjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【COMMEMORATING Meaning】: The phoenix is a mythical bird with colorful feathers and a golden and scarlet tail. In ancient Greek and Egyptian mythology, it was described as a big bird, like an eagle, with supernatural powers that can be resurrected. The phoenix bird is regarded as a symbol of immortality, rebirth and life after death, which is why so many people worship it and decorate houses with it.Width -8.1\" (20 cm), Height - 8.1\" (20 cm),Weight - 0,9 lb (0,39 kg). 🔥【Perfect Gift For Family & Friends】: The stained glass firebird is a great gift for your friends, family, relatives and yourself.The lovely phoenix bird symbolizes the eternity of the loved ones around us, and the loved ones we lost will always be in our thoughts, motivating, inspiring, and empowering us.Our stained glass masterpieces will be a good decoration. Just imagine how the sun catcher in Phoenix put icing on the windows! 🔥【Warm Home Decor】: Looking forward to catching the late afternoon sun of 2021. THIS IS A SPECIAL WAY OF COMMEMORATING.We often miss our lost loved ones, which makes us feel lonely. We pin our thoughts on this, which makes us feel that they are by our side.Exquisite and unique healing hanging ornament for home/office/wall/garden/car/balcony/porch decoration, meditation, yoga, energy balancing. 🔥【Durable Material & Easy To Set Up】: Acrylic material, strong and durable, not fragile and easy to clean. Our pendants can be used both indoors and outdoors.All our window decorations come with a swivel, hook and stainless steel wire rope. Simply find a place to place hang your wind spinner or make one by using a nail or screw. 🔥【100% Customer Satisfaction】: Package contains 1x Phoenix decoration pendant. Single Phoenix and Double Phoenix styles to choose.Our Concern is to Give a Best Support to Customer.We Care about You and Your Satisfaction is Our Achievement.If you have any question, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mj-Eu0sjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lkoezi","source_asin":"B092M7QFTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092M7QFTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092M7QFTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":521628,"name":"It's Cactus Veve Erzulie Dantor, Sacred, Pure Heart, Handmade in Haiti, Metal Wall Decor, 17 In. x 21 In.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ml4SizL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In Haiti there is an important group of female loa (goddesses) whose first name is Erzulie. While all of them share in their role as Goddess of love, art, and sex, each has additional areas of life which is theirs to defend and assist. Erzulie is three in aspect: she can be Erzulie Freda, a virgin goddess likened to the Virgin Mary; Erzulie Dantor, loa of jealousy and passion; or La Siren, a personification of the sea and goddess of motherhood. As Freda, her color is pink, her animal a white dove. As Dantor, her colors are blue and gold. She is associated with the Lukumi Orisha Oshun, and sometimes Chango (as Erzulie Dantor).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ml4SizL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B0756LGL3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0756LGL3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0756LGL3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
