window.products.push({"id":521679,"name":"Eucalyptus Flower Garland (5.5 Feet) - Greenery Garland Artificial Rose Vines Garland Fake Greenery UV and Fade-Resistant Handmade Silk Faux Fall Flow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A6xWegHYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bekka Bianka creates lifelike faux flowers and greeneries for gorgeous weddings, parties and home decor. We carefully select all colors and materials to achieve stunning realism and frost our branches for a lush green look that mimics real leaves. Whether you “just can’t” with another wilted plant or want beautiful wedding greenery that survives the summer heat, you’ll love how versatile Bekka Bianka products are. We don’t believe in frustrating assembly, so we make sure our eucalyptus branches look perfect before you ever take them out of the box. No assembling leaves or combining multiple pieces to achieve a fuller look! Simply remove from the box and hang anywhere you’d like for easy elegance in seconds. The durable inner wire makes it easy peasy to adjust your vine garland, so shaping is a breeze, too!It’s the perfect way to add a splash of green to wedding arches and reception tables, kitchen countertops and fireplace mantles, pillars and light posts, holiday and birthday parties and anything else you can dream up.To make your faux eucalyptus garland even more breathtaking, you can pop off a few leaves and add in flower heads like peonies, sunflowers and lavender, or flowers that match the season. Let your creativity shine! Q: How hard is the garland to clean? A: Super easy! All you need is a wet cloth and it wipes down in just a few minutes. You can use a duster, too! Q: What if a leaf falls off? Can I put it back on? A: Absolutely. If a leaf falls off, you can easily pop it back into the vine! Our artificial eucalyptus makes the perfect: ✓ Home decor✓ Wedding decor✓ Mantle and fireplace decor✓ Garden party decoration✓ Corporate event decoration✓ Holiday and birthday gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A6xWegHYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bekka Bianka","source_asin":"B07WJW94H7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WJW94H7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WJW94H7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
