window.products.push({"id":521725,"name":"Alvantor Bed Canopy Tents Dream Privacy Space Twin Bunk Bed Sleeping Tents Indoor Pop Up Portable Frame Curtains Breathable Grey Cottage (Mattress Not","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mka442hkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pongee Imported ♥Upgraded 2-in-1 bed tent patent pending construction. Double side-door design for easier access. No collapsing, no bend, no leans off, no instability, no metal frame and no rips. Pop up flexible ribbed frame make it easiest assembly and lightest sleeping tent on the market, only 4.5 lbs! Used with your existing mattress, no need to attach to bed frame, or even used by itself as a privacy tent on floor anywhere. Mattress Not Included. See video for set-up and take down tutorials! ♥Innovative design: Durable pop-up flexible ribs and fiberglass rods help this tent keep it’s shape and stable. High quality pongee fabric is breathable and soft. Dark grey colour is light reducing and allows you to see out, but no one to see in. Zipped doors on both sides allow to open it completely and mesh on the head and foot provide good airflow and wanted light. The whole floor sits under the mattress- no slip! Storage pocket and light hanging loop on top are convenient. ♥Easy set up and take down.. pop up frame and shock corded poles make it super easy to set up in a minute. Fold down instant and figure 8 into compact portable carrying bag. size 20.8 x 18.9 x 2.8 inches and weight 4.5 lbs. The privacy curtain is washable clean and easy to store. When laundry, just unzip the end of arc pole sleeves and pull out the pole. After laundry, insert the poles and zip the pole sleeve. ♥Versatile usage: this bed curtains measures 75 x 39 x 39H inches for twin bunk beds. Create a privacy space anywhere or spill large rooms like dorms and barracks into private suites. Turn your bed into a solitude and seclusion with reducing light and noise. This sleep space provides you better sleep during sleep time, nap time ,single time and fun time. This privacy net also makes a fun bed fort around the bed. With whole floor, it is also a play tent by itself anywhere indoor. ♥Accessories: A mesh pocket inside the tent, convenient to store your cell phone, book etc.. Double-sided zippers can open & close the doors from inside and outside as like. Including: bed tent x 1, shock poles x 3, carry bag x 1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mka442hkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alvantor","source_asin":"B084CZXK34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-521725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084CZXK34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084CZXK34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
